Description: allow a persistent custom eMMC card identification register
 Add an optional emmc.cid property containing a complete 16-byte hexadecimal
 register value. Validate before realize and reapply on reset while keeping
 the existing CID migration state and default SD/eMMC identities unchanged.
 Cover default/custom CID responses, leading zeroes, reset and invalid input.
 Document SDHCI's omission of the final CRC byte from Linux sysfs readback.
Forwarded: no

